  "smell_signature": "Combined together, these ingredients will smell like tearing open a bright packet of instant goodness—zesty orange peel and just-cut grass hit first with a juicy, electric rush. The heart blooms into tropical flowers and ripe stone fruit, like a bustling Asian night market at golden hour. Finally, a subtle toasted nuttiness and clean white florals linger, like the steam rising from a freshly mixed bowl of noodles on a crisp morning. Think of a modern fragrance for someone who wants their scent as lively and unapologetic as their favorite comfort food ritual.",
